WEBVTT

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:28.400
Subame? Are you going to the harbor? You worry so. He has always come back to me. I know he'll come back, no matter what has happened to him.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:38.290
I see you sing.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:37.830
Oh, can't you see it, babe, you've got me gone.
